      ],
      "title": "Fleet compliance",
      "description": "Compliant over compliant plus non-compliant, across every control assignment. Pending, stale and unmeasurable repositories are outside the denominator. Reads 'no data' rather than 100% when nothing is assigned, because an unmeasured fleet is not a compliant one.",
